 ],
 "balloons": [
  {
   "panel": "page-01-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "You remember the festival night, when you fell on the temple stones.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ramayyan",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-01-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "Not every knife announces itself.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ramayyan",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-01-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "If a king cannot sit with his god without a wall of men between them, he is already dead.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "prince",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-02-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "If you die, so do many of us who had no say in that decision.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ramayyan",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-02-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "And if the heir dies with you, this kingdom becomes a feast.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ramayyan",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-02-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "You will have your men. They will wait here.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-02-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "Then take Ananthan. If you insist on trusting no one else with your back tonight, at least trust the man who has seen how Europeans strike.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "You will walk behind. You will watch the boy. You will speak only if spoken to.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "Do not bring your Deccan noise into my god's courtyard.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "If I breathe too often under carved ceilings, I forget what rain smells like on bare rock.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "prince",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "Wait here. If anyone comes, tell them the king is scolding his god and does not wish to be scolded in return.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "prince",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Ayya. The priest is busy. You may have to wait.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "CHAVER"
   ],
   "text": "...Eight Houses... vow... chaver... heir...",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "prince",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "ASSISTANT"
   ],
   "text": "Shiva!",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "CHAVER"
   ],
   "text": "For the old houses.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": []
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-05",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "CHAVER"
   ],
   "text": "For those he broke.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": []
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-09-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "CHAVER (small, fading)"
   ],
   "text": "For the old...",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": []
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-10-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "You are hurt.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-10-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "So are you.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-10-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PRIEST"
   ],
   "text": "Maharaja... forgive... he came as any other...",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "temple_priest",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-10-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "Quiet. Fetch water. Clean cloth. And send a boy down to Ramayyan.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "temple_priest",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-10-panel-04",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "Tell him the king has slipped on the temple steps and needs a bandage.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "temple_priest",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-10-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "Chaver. From the Kayamkulam frontier, most likely. One of the old Eight Houses that still dream of undoing me.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "prince",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-10-panel-05",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "He came for the heir. Not for me.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "prince",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "He said it was for the old houses.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "temple_priest",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "Men like him are always for something old. They rarely live long enough to see whether the old was worth killing for.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "temple_priest",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "If there are any remnants of the Eight Houses still hiding in these hills, I want chavers sent into their courtyards.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "No last cousin with a purse. No temple man willing to whisper for them. Nothing.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "You could have stepped aside. I would be lying broken on this stone now, and you would have a clear road north.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "I did not think. My body moved.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "Bodies move toward what they trust. Remember that.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "Steps. You slipped on the steps.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "prince",
    "ramayyan",
    "temple_priest",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-05",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "The gods are clumsy hosts.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "prince",
    "ramayyan",
    "temple_priest",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "I count chiefs who murmur. I watch Dutch papers.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "I did not know one had sent a chaver after the heir.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "If you had, you would have forbidden me to climb that hill. I would have gone anyway.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "Yes.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ramayyan",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "That is why it infuriates me.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ramayyan",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "You took the blade meant for the heir. That buys you more than thanks.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "It confirms something I had been weighing.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "Ram worries about the north, and your hills calling. I worry about the Kayamkulam frontier.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-05",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "I need men whose first instinct, when a dagger appears, is to move toward my chest, and his, not away from it.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-13-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "So I will give you what I once offered and you once refused.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-13-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "A permanent command on the Kayamkulam frontier. Horse that answer to your word.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-13-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "If you accept, you tie yourself to this kingdom in a way that will be hard to undo.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-13-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "If you later ride north, you will not go as a free blade, but as a man breaking his own oath.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-13-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "A chaver in reverse. Sworn to die in one place instead of to kill in another.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-13-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "Something like that.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-13-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "You do not have to answer now. Decisions made when the smell of iron is still in the nose can feel different when it fades.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-13-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "No. If I think too long, I will count too many futures and ride in none.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-13-panel-05",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "I am tired of standing with one foot in each river.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-14-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "I will take your frontier. I will build horse there that answer to this land.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-14-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "I will send word north of what I have chosen.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-14-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "If the Peshwa or his men think me traitor, they can write my name in their own books.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-14-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "I have no space left in mine for their judgments.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-14-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "So noted.",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": [
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-14-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "To clumsy gods and fast horses.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-14-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "To careful reckonings that keep us alive long enough to regret our choices.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-15-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "So. You finally decided which current to trust. I hope your horse can swim.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-15-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "They can. I am less sure about their rider.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  }
 ]
}